	(text "Channels 1-8: 2x photoMOS contact closure (RESET, PWR BTN) per motherboard front-panel header. Floating outputs.\nTLP176AM: 3mA max trigger, ~6.5mA drive (270R). U14 MCP23017 @0x20 sources the LED current: GPA0-7 = PWR_DRV1-8, GPB0-7 = RST_DRV1-8 (GPA7/GPB7 are output-only).\nR32 holds U14 and U15 in reset unless the MCU drives EXP_nRESET_INT high: MCU reset/hang -> all GPIO Hi-Z -> all buttons released.\nU14/U15 are on the internal I2C bus; EXP_INT is shared with add-on modules on the expansion header (INT open-drain, mirrored)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d42135b5-6198-4a0f-b9a2-2f232278c836")
	)
	(text "Node connector J11-J18 (JST PH 5p): 1 PWR_SW, 2 RST_SW, 3 node GND (common return of both buttons), 4 PLED+, 5 PLED-.\nPLED sense: TLP290-4 (AC input, either polarity), 220R in series with the node's own LED resistor, 47k pull-up -> NODE_ONn low = node power LED lit.\nU15 MCP23017 @0x21: GPA0-6 = NODE_ON1-7, GPB4 = NODE_ON8 (GPA7 is output-only), GPB0-3 = DRY_IN1-4 (expansion sheet), GPB5-7 spare."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 285.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "50a2943c-fd6e-4d5f-9290-f26508e1866c")
	)
)
